\section{Split and leakage controls}
Official chronological train, validation, and test partitions were preserved. A
24-row purge was applied at exposed boundaries without reallocating rows. Validation
was divided chronologically into a 70\% model-selection block and a 30\% uncertainty
calibration block, with another 24-row purge between them. Inputs with gaps above
\VAR{summary.resolved_configuration.data.forecast.maximum_gap_minutes|num} minutes
were rejected. Normalization and imputation were fitted on train only.

